{title: 069 - Lord, Make Us More Holy}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #069 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 69}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Lord, make us more holy;
Lord, make us more holy;
Lord, make us more holy
Until we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Lord, make us more faithful;
Lord, make us more faithful;
Lord, make us more faithful
Until we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Lord, make us more humble;
Lord, make us more humble;
Lord, make us more humble
Until we meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Lord, make us more loving;
Lord, make us more loving;
Lord, make us more loving
Until we meet again.
Like Jesus, the Savior,
Until we meet again.
{end_of_verse}
